<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>LMG-E Recoil for Ram/Zofia</Major>
    <Description>A recoil reduction macro for LMG-E. LMG recoils are hard to manage for long bursts, and the LMG-E was especially screwed post LMG nerf without it being fully rectified. This was designed to make an entire mag dump possible on even a small mousepad. Micro adjustments are needed, but you should be able to acheive 100% upper body shot hits at any range with a little practice. IF you are looking for headshots, I would recommend lowering the mouse movement and just manually adjusting, as macros struggle with the jumps that can happen every 10-15 shots in

Loadout: Vert, acog, comp

Res: 16:10, 1920 x1080

Sensitivity 6,6

800 Dpi</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -1 47 0 48
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 0 58
Delay 25 ms
MoveR 0 53
Delay 25 ms
MoveR -15 48
Delay 25 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>